OL,3,GNEWSANI only part of UK to see increase
OL,4,Ain employment
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe number of workers on company
OL,7,Fpayrolls in Northern Ireland in October
OL,8,Fis 1% higher than the same time last
OL,9,Fyear at 822,800.
OL,11,FNorthern Ireland was the only UK region
OL,12,Fto report an increase over the last 12
OL,13,Fmonths
OL,15,FThe typical monthly pay-packet was
OL,16,F#2,525 last month. This is an increase
OL,17,Fof #122 or 5.1% over the year.
OL,19,FWhether or not wage growth outpaced the
OL,20,Frate at which prices are rising, which
OL,21,Fis known as inflation, is a key
OL,22,Findicator of the cost of living.
